# UI rules — follow on every screen

Read `docs/design/BRAND.md` before building any UI. Component specifics: `docs/design/components/*.md`.
Reference CSS showing exact sizes, colors and motion for each component: `docs/design/reference-components.css`
(port it to Tailwind + shadcn/ui; keep the values).

## Tokens
- Colors, spacing, radii, shadows, durations, easings, blur and sizes come ONLY from `src/styles/tokens.css`
  (a copy of `docs/design/tokens.css`). Never hard-code a hex, px spacing, duration or easing in a component.
- Tailwind maps to the CSS variables (e.g. `bg-surface`, `text-ink-muted`, `border-border-control`,
  `rounded-md` = `--radius-md`, `duration-base`, `ease-spring`). shadcn/ui theme variables are re-pointed to these tokens.
- `primary` (#007A3A light / #34C77B dark) is the single action color. Logo colors `brand-*` are decoration only, never text.
- Status = color + icon + word, mapped as in BRAND.md "Status mapping". Never color alone.
- Focus: 2px solid `--focus` ring, 2px offset, on everything focusable.

## Type
- `next/font/google`: Public Sans (400/500/600) as `--font-sans`, Source Serif 4 (600) as `--font-serif`,
  JetBrains Mono (500) as `--font-mono`. Serif ONLY for page titles. Mono for protocol codes, form codes, versions.
- Use the type utilities from tokens: `title`, `heading`, `subheading`, `body`, `body-sm`, `label`, `caption`, `code`.

## Layout
- Vertical sidebar first (`--sidebar-width` 264px, rail `--sidebar-rail` 72px, collapsible, remembered per user;
  drawer under 1024px). Top bar 56px: breadcrumb, search (staff/chairs), notifications, theme switch.
- Content max 1120px; forms 760px, left-aligned. Cards: border + `radius-md`, no shadow. Shadows only on floating UI.
- Phones: assessment tables become stacked cards; touch targets ≥ 44px.

## Motion (use the `motion` package only for layout animations; CSS for the rest)
- Button: hover color `dur-fast`; press `scale(0.97)` in `dur-instant`; release `ease-spring` over `dur-base`.
- Toggle: thumb moves with `ease-spring` over `dur-base`, stretches 4px while pressed.
- Checkbox: tick draws in over `dur-fast`; box bounces to 1.08 with `ease-spring`.
- Tabs / segmented: sliding indicator with `ease-spring`.
- Sidebar collapse: width over `dur-slow` with `ease-out-soft`; labels fade; active marker slides (motion `layoutId`).
- Menus/popovers: fade + 4px rise, `dur-base`, `ease-out-soft`. Page content: fade + 8px rise on navigation, `dur-slow`.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: replace movement and springs with 120ms opacity fades.

## Loading — NO SPINNERS, ever
- First load: render the real layout with placeholder bars (`rec-bar` look) inside a wrapper blurred with `--blur-loading`;
  when data arrives, sharpen over `dur-reveal`. Every route has a `loading.tsx` doing this. No layout shift.
- Refresh/pending (`useTransition`, filters, pagination): keep content, blur `--blur-stale`, opacity 0.7, no pointer events.
- Busy buttons: `aria-busy="true"`, keep width, label in -ing form ("Submitting…"), 2px sweep along the bottom.
- Long jobs: inline progress row with a determinate bar when progress is known.
- Build one `<BlurLoad state="loading|ready|stale">` component and one `<BusyButton>`; use them everywhere.

## Theming
- Light, Dark, System (default). Choice in a cookie `theme`; root layout reads it on the server and sets
  `data-theme` on `<html>` (System → a tiny inline script resolves `prefers-color-scheme` before paint and listens for changes).
- Switching crossfades colors over `dur-base`. Every token has both theme values; check contrast in both.
- Uploaded documents and signature images sit on a white plate in dark mode.

## Never
Purple/blue-purple gradients, glassmorphism, glow, emoji or sparkle icons, greeting banners, centered hero sections in the app,
drop-shadow cards everywhere, colored left-border cards, filler stat tiles, lorem ipsum, Inter/Roboto, spinners, bouncing dots,
shimmer sweeps across skeletons, toasts for inline feedback.
